00:09:34.640 --> 00:09:36.041
He doesn't do anything fast.

00:09:36.041 --> 00:09:37.976
He lumbers around the
White House lawn in circles

00:09:37.976 --> 00:09:40.646
like he's lookin' for a golf
ball he shanked off the tee.

00:09:40.646 --> 00:09:42.113
[ As Trump ]
Anyone see a Titleist 3?

00:09:42.113 --> 00:09:43.782
Little boobs drawn on it.

00:09:43.782 --> 00:09:46.351
The guy's Frankenstein,
if he was spraying for weeds.

00:09:46.351 --> 00:09:48.687
"Crabgrass, bad!"

00:09:48.687 --> 00:09:50.655
Even more deranged
than the sycophantic

00:09:50.655 --> 00:09:52.791
dear-leader praise
of the president's golf game

00:09:52.791 --> 00:09:55.761
is the fact that a U.S. senator
chose to spend his time

00:09:55.761 --> 00:09:59.431
tweeting about this and not,
say, a plea to his constituents

00:09:59.431 --> 00:10:01.634
and fellow conservatives
to wear masks,

00:10:01.634 --> 00:10:03.268
especially since his
colleague Ted Cruz

00:10:03.268 --> 00:10:05.905
apparently refused
to wear one on a flight.

00:10:05.905 --> 00:10:08.173
Man, you'd think Ted Cruz would
at least wanna wear a mask

00:10:08.173 --> 00:10:10.409
so no one would see
that his beard makes him look

00:10:10.409 --> 00:10:11.643
like an out-of-work hedgehog.

00:10:11.643 --> 00:10:14.246
I'm sorry, but not wearin'
a mask is now officially

00:10:14.246 --> 00:10:15.948
the [bleep] thing
you can do on a flight.

00:10:15.948 --> 00:10:18.383
And I am including wearing
open-toed sandals.

00:10:18.383 --> 00:10:21.053
You foot freaks are off the hook
until this pandemic is over.

00:10:21.053 --> 00:10:22.888
This is the conservative
movement of Donald Trump,

00:10:22.888 --> 00:10:24.623
a movement that rejects
science and empathy

00:10:24.623 --> 00:10:26.459
in favor of dumb
culture war grievances

00:10:26.459 --> 00:10:28.560
like statues and cancel culture.

00:10:28.560 --> 00:10:31.463
As a highly infectious deadly
disease spreads like wildfire,

00:10:31.463 --> 00:10:34.466
the supposedly pro-life party
has abandoned you.

00:10:34.466 --> 00:10:35.901
Scared of gettin' sick?

00:10:35.901 --> 00:10:38.270
The White House says, "Too bad,
we need to live with it."

00:10:38.270 --> 00:10:40.673
Lost your job amid
the worst economic crisis

00:10:40.673 --> 00:10:41.941
since the Great Depression?

00:10:41.941 --> 00:10:44.410 line:0%
The only advice they have is
find something new,

00:10:44.410 --> 00:10:47.012 line:0%
courtesy of the new ad campaign
rolled out by Ivanka Trump,

00:10:47.012 --> 00:10:49.047 line:0%
who, famously, has found
many jobs on her own,

00:10:49.047 --> 00:10:50.615 line:0%
with no help from her father.

00:10:50.615 --> 00:10:53.119 line:0%
Ivanka Trump is the last person
who should be lecturing anyone

00:10:53.119 --> 00:10:56.255 line:0%
on learning new skills
to cope with a job loss.

00:10:56.255 --> 00:10:57.690 line:0%
The only skills she has are

00:10:57.690 --> 00:11:00.526 line:0%
having a rich father,
making scarves that catch fire,

00:11:00.526 --> 00:11:04.163
and unnaturally holding up
a can of beans,

00:11:04.163 --> 00:11:06.432
as she demonstrated
with this incredibly dumb

00:11:06.432 --> 00:11:09.034
and, most likely,
illegal tweet last night,

00:11:09.034 --> 00:11:12.471
advertising Goya
after the CEO praised Trump.

00:11:12.471 --> 00:11:13.806
She looks like she's auditioning

00:11:13.806 --> 00:11:15.307
to be a game show model
in the '80s.

00:11:15.307 --> 00:11:18.310
"Oh, the vaccine was
behind door number 1,

00:11:18.310 --> 00:11:21.414
but you've won a year's
supply of Goya beans!

00:11:21.414 --> 00:11:23.281
Show 'em the beans, Ivanka."

00:11:23.281 --> 00:11:24.950
What do you even call

00:11:24.950 --> 00:11:28.821
a person who takes that photo
in the middle of a pandemic?

00:11:28.821 --> 00:11:30.455
-The bean queen!

00:11:30.455 --> 00:11:32.691
She won't be likin'
that nickname.

00:11:32.691 --> 00:11:35.494
-[ Chuckling ]
-Oh, thank you, Sea Captain.

00:11:35.494 --> 00:11:37.362
-It be me pleasure.

00:11:37.362 --> 00:11:38.863
-But it's not just
the Trump White House.

00:11:38.863 --> 00:11:41.066
Millionaire right-wing pundits
are also telling you,

00:11:41.066 --> 00:11:43.201
from the safety and comfort
of their homes and studios,

00:11:43.201 --> 00:11:44.436
to suck it up and deal with it.

00:11:44.436 --> 00:11:47.273
Here's Fox News host
Laura Ingraham on Monday,

00:11:47.273 --> 00:11:48.808
arguing that the coronavirus

00:11:48.808 --> 00:11:50.509
is just something
we have to live with.

00:11:50.509 --> 00:11:52.244 line:0%
-No more lockdowns.

00:11:52.244 --> 00:11:55.214 line:0%
Viruses are a fact of life.

00:11:55.214 --> 00:11:56.449 line:0%
And it's very sad.

00:11:56.449 --> 00:11:59.018 line:0%
And sometimes, as with COVID-19,

00:11:59.018 --> 00:12:01.387 line:0%
