tragic results.

00:12:01.387 --> 00:12:03.521
-Oh, so viruses are just
a fact of life?

00:12:03.521 --> 00:12:05.224
Cool. Then, why don't you take
your show on the road

00:12:05.224 --> 00:12:07.526
