to cough on you.

00:12:14.132 --> 00:12:15.968
You can sit next to Ted Cruz.

00:12:15.968 --> 00:12:18.270
11B is open.

00:12:18.270 --> 00:12:21.606
On Tuesday, Rush Limbaugh
cited the Donner Party --

00:12:21.606 --> 00:12:24.142
you know, the cannibals --

00:12:24.142 --> 00:12:26.511
as an example of how we should
adapt to the pandemic.

00:12:26.511 --> 00:12:27.879
[ Laughing ]
And I really --

00:12:27.879 --> 00:12:31.683
Guys, I really wish
I was exaggerating, but,

00:12:31.683 --> 00:12:32.718
yeah, I'm not.

00:12:32.718 --> 00:12:34.552
-The Donner Party,
the Donner family

00:12:34.552 --> 00:12:37.156
and a bunch of travelers tryin'
to get to California

00:12:37.156 --> 00:12:39.625
over the Sierra Nevada
Mountain range.

00:12:39.625 --> 00:12:41.593
They made the mistake
of tryin' to make the trip

00:12:41.593 --> 00:12:43.929
in the middle of winter.

00:12:43.929 --> 00:12:46.799
We're talkin'
the Lake Tahoe region.

00:12:46.799 --> 00:12:50.169
They get to the peak.
It was so bad

00:12:50.169 --> 00:12:53.472
that they had to turn
to cannibalism to survive!

00:12:53.472 --> 00:12:55.641
That's what's noteworthy
about the Donner Party.

00:12:55.641 --> 00:12:58.310
If you read the diaries

00:12:58.310 --> 00:13:01.347
