to how cold it was

00:13:03.515 --> 00:13:05.618
was one sentence --

00:13:05.618 --> 00:13:09.721
"It was a particularly
tough winter."

00:13:09.721 --> 00:13:11.423
It's just what was.

00:13:11.423 --> 00:13:13.225
They didn't complain about it

00:13:13.225 --> 00:13:15.127
because there was nothing
they could do.

00:13:15.127 --> 00:13:18.363
They had to adapt!

00:13:18.363 --> 00:13:20.666
This is what's missing!

00:13:20.666 --> 00:13:24.369
There seems to be no concept
of adaptation!

00:13:24.369 --> 00:13:28.440
There seems to be
no understanding,

00:13:28.440 --> 00:13:29.908
in the millennial generation,

00:13:29.908 --> 00:13:33.044
that we can adapt to this
and that we're gonna have to.

00:13:33.044 --> 00:13:34.379
-Finally, the Republicans

00:13:34.379 --> 00:13:36.215
